":106.32,"end":106.92},{"word":"those","start":106.92,"end":107.2},{"word":"venerable","start":107.2,"end":107.76},{"word":"whiskers,","start":107.76,"end":108.8},{"word":"\"who","start":108.8,"end":109.04},{"word":"have","start":109.04,"end":109.28},{"word":"fled","start":109.28,"end":109.6},{"word":"the","start":109.6,"end":109.8},{"word":"eternal","start":109.8,"end":110.32},{"word":"prison","start":110.32,"end":110.8},{"word":"against","start":110.8,"end":111.16},{"word":"the","start":111.16,"end":111.36},{"word":"current","start":111.36,"end":111.76},{"word":"of","start":111.76,"end":111.92},{"word":"that","start":111.92,"end":112.16},{"word":"blind","start":112.16,"end":112.72},{"word":"river?","start":112.72,"end":113.76},{"word":"Are","start":113.76,"end":113.96},{"word":"the","start":113.96,"end":114.08},{"word":"laws","start":114.08,"end":114.52},{"word":"of","start":114.52,"end":114.64},{"word":"the","start":114.64,"end":114.72},{"word":"abyss","start":114.72,"end":115.2},{"word":"broken?","start":115.2,"end":116.44},{"word":"Has","start":116.44,"end":116.68},{"word":"some","start":116.68,"end":116.88},{"word":"new","start":116.88,"end":117.12},{"word":"decree","start":117.12,"end":117.68},{"word":"been","start":117.68,"end":117.92},{"word":"passed","start":117.92,"end":118.32},{"word":"in","start":118.32,"end":118.48},{"word":"heaven","start":118.48,"end":118.88},{"word":"that","start":118.88,"end":119.04},{"word":"allows","start":119.04,"end":119.48},{"word":"the","start":119.48,"end":119.68},{"word":"damned","start":119.68,"end":120.24},{"word":"to","start":120.24,"end":120.4},{"word":"reach","start":120.4,"end":120.72},{"word":"my","start":120.72,"end":120.96},{"word":"shores?","start":120.96,"end":121.68}]},{"id":3,"speaker":"narrator","text":"My guide placed his hands on me,\nand with words, gestures, and signs\nmade me bow my knees and head in reverence.\nThen he answered: \"I did not come of my own will.\nA lady descended from heaven, and at her request\nI joined this man as his companion.\nBut since you wish to know more\nabout our true condition,\nI cannot refuse to tell you.\nThis man has never seen his final evening,\nbut through his folly came so close to it\nthat very little time remained to turn back.\nAs I said, I was sent to rescue him—\nthere was no other way\nthan this path I have taken.\nI have shown him all the lost souls,\nand now I intend to show him those spirits\nwho purify themselves under your guardianship.\nHow I brought him here would take too long to tell.\nA power from on high assists me\nin leading him to see and hear you.\nNow may it please you to welcome his coming.\nHe seeks liberty, which is so precious—\nas anyone knows who dies for her sake.\nYou know this well, for death in Utica\nwas not bitter to you for her sake,\nwhere you left behind the flesh that will shine so bright on judgment day.\nWe do not break the eternal laws:\nthis man still lives, and Minos does not bind me.\nI come from that circle where dwell\nthe chaste eyes of your Marcia,\nwho still seems to plead with you\nin her gaze, O holy soul, to hold her as your own.\nFor love of her, then, be gracious to us.\nAllow us passage through your seven realms.\nI will carry news of this kindness back to her,\nif you care to be remembered there below.\"","startTime":121.68,"endTime":218.24,"words":[{"word":"My","start":121.92,"end":122.24},{"word":"guide","start":122.24,"end":122.48},{"word":"placed","start":122.48,"end":122.88},{"word":"his","start":122.88,"end":123.04},{"word":"hands","start":123.04,"end":123.36},{"word":"on","start":123.36,"end":123.6},{"word":"me,","start":123.6,"end":124.24},{"word":"and","start":124.24,"end":124.4},{"word":"with","start":124.4,"end":124.56},{"word":"words,","start":124.56,"end":125.36},{"word":"gestures,","start":125.36,"end":126.08},{"word":"and","start":126.08,"end":126.36},{"word":"signs","start":126.36,"end":127.12},{"word":"made","start":127.12,"end":127.4},{"word":"me","start":1